    "text": "By KPLC Digital Team Caleb Carter ,\n1 days ago LAKE CHARLES, La. (KPLC) - Today is Sept. 25 — 9/25 — and people across Southwest Louisiana and the state spent the day honoring the legacy of Dolly Parton, blending celebration with a push for childhood literacy. Communities around the world dedicate Sept. 25 to Parton each year... Read full article",
